Configuration files used for integration tests

anvil.json contains an anvil snapshot of a settlement chain that has a nitro rollup deployed to it.
It has 8 pending messages in the delayed inbox created at deployment time.

stylus-counter-smartcache is from https://arbiscan.io/address/0x41dd659b49617daedfb355d1dd0a283fd8c0dd5c#code
It has the creation code for a stylus contract.
